<!doctype html>
<!-- Managed by obcell (roles/owntracks/templates/join.html.j2). Holds the secret post URL. -->
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>Add your phone to {{ obcell_name }}</title>
<style>
  :root { --bg: #f6f7f9; --fg: #1d2330; --muted: #5b6475; --card: #fff; --line: #d9dde5; --accent: #1f6feb; --on-accent: #fff; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root { --bg: #11151c; --fg: #e6e9ef; --muted: #9aa3b2; --card: #1a2029; --line: #2c3440; --accent: #4c8dff; --on-accent: #0b0f15; }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
  main { max-width: 34rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 .25rem; }
  .sub { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  ol { list-style: none; counter-reset: step; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  ol > li { counter-increment: step; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1rem 1rem 1rem 3.25rem; margin: 0 0 .75rem; position: relative; }
  ol > li::before { content: counter(step); position: absolute; left: 1rem; top: 1rem; width: 1.6rem; height: 1.6rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); color: var(--on-accent); font-weight: 700; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: .9rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0 0 .35rem; }
  p { margin: .35rem 0; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  .qr { background: #fff; padding: .75rem; border-radius: 10px; width: min(100%, 17rem); margin: .75rem 0; }
  .qr.small { width: min(100%, 10rem); }
  .qr svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .button { display: inline-block; background: var(--accent); color: var(--on-accent); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; padding: .6rem 1rem; border-radius: 8px; margin: .25rem 0; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: .92rem; }
  details { margin-top: 1rem; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: .75rem 1rem; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
  code { font: .85rem/1.4 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; word-break: break-all; background: var(--bg); padding: .1rem .3rem; border-radius: 4px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>Add your phone to {{ obcell_name }}</h1>
  <p class="sub">Your phone reports where it is to the {{ obcell_name }} Obcell, so the production team can see the crew on a map.</p>

  <ol>
    <li>
      <h2>Install OwnTracks</h2>
      <p><a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id692424691">iPhone (App Store)</a> · <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.owntracks.android">Android (Google Play)</a> · <a href="https://f-droid.org/packages/org.owntracks.android/">F-Droid</a></p>
      <p class="muted">Open it once, and allow location access ("Always" lets it report in the background).</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h2>Load the settings</h2>
      <p>Scan this code with the phone's camera and open it in OwnTracks.</p>
      <div class="qr" role="img" aria-label="QR code with the OwnTracks settings">{{ qr_config }}</div>
      <p>Reading this on the phone? <a class="button" href="{{ owntracks_app_config_uri }}">Set up OwnTracks</a></p>
      <p class="muted">No account or password. The settings only tell the app where to send positions.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h2>Say who you are</h2>
      <p>In OwnTracks' settings, set a <strong>username</strong> (your name), a <strong>device ID</strong> (e.g. <code>iphone</code>) and a <strong>tracker ID</strong> (two letters, shown on the map). Until then the phone shows up under a default name.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <details>
    <summary>The camera doesn't offer to open OwnTracks</summary>
    <p>Some Android cameras only open web links. Scan this one instead; it opens this page on the phone, then tap <em>Set up OwnTracks</em>. It works on the {{ obcell_name }} Wi-Fi or cell.</p>
    <div class="qr small" role="img" aria-label="QR code that opens this page">{{ qr_page }}</div>
    <p class="muted"><code>http://{{ obcell_lan_ip }}/join/</code></p>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary>Set it up by hand</summary>
    <p>In OwnTracks' settings: <strong>Mode</strong> HTTP, <strong>URL</strong>:</p>
    <p><code>{{ owntracks_app_url }}</code></p>
    <p class="muted">No authentication.
{% if owntracks_funnel %}
      This address works anywhere the phone has internet.
{% elif obcell_tailnet_name %}
      This address only works on phones with the Tailscale app on the {{ obcell_name }} tailnet.
{% else %}
      This address only works on the {{ obcell_name }} network, and the phone must trust its certificate.
{% endif %}
    </p>
  </details>
</main>
</body>
</html>
